// The X-Plane 12 channel dictionary: what each Data.txt header token means, by token and occurrence.
// Built once from X-Plane 12 research notes that are not part of this repo (Laminar Research manuals and knowledge
// base, X-Plane 12 DataRefs.txt, public X-Plane Data.txt headers and UDP tools). Edit it by hand: clearer labels and
// short names go in overrides.ts, and the lookup tables are built in entries.ts.
// CHANNEL_ROWS are grouped by Data Output row (groupRows.ts), X-Plane 12 tokens first, then older spellings.
// Occurrence = n-th time the token appears in a header with every row ticked in display order.

import type { ChannelRow } from './schema'

